flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T17:17:09.1069390Z ^[[0m
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T17:17:09.1070054Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T17:17:09.1070764Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T17:17:09.1071136Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T17:17:09.1071522Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T17:17:09.1073231Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T17:17:09.1073955Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T17:17:09.1074310Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T17:17:09.1075023Z    if you are ready to continue.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T17:17:09.1075385Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T17:17:09.1076053Z 3. Create the system users ^[[34m(uids [30001..30008])^[[0m and groups ^[[34m(gid 30000)^[[0m
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T17:17:09.1076662Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T17:17:09.1077200Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T17:17:09.1077654Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T17:17:09.1078007Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T17:17:09.1078374Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T17:17:09.1078860Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T17:17:09.1079122Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T17:17:09.1079559Z    can use Nix.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T17:17:09.1079722Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T17:17:09.1079838Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T17:17:09.1080030Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T17:17:09.1080353Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T17:17:09.1080852Z ^[[0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T17:17:09.1083110Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T17:17:09.1083345Z I will:
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T17:17:09.1083804Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T17:17:09.1084206Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T17:17:09.1084974Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T17:17:09.1085452Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T17:17:09.1085908Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T17:17:09.1086229Z  - install Nix in /nix
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T17:17:09.1086522Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T17:17:09.1086983Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T17:17:09.1087401Z    /root
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T17:17:09.1098537Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T17:17:09.1099404Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T17:17:09.1110055Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-11T17:17:09.1110746Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
